  "body_html": "<p>Wrap yourself in cozy warmth and stunning Native American style with the Wolf Dreamcatcher Quilt by Jeminise. Perfect for animal lovers and those who appreciate southwestern decor, this lightweight and breathable quilt brings both functional comfort and beautiful artistry into any bedroom or living space. Whether you are relaxing on the sofa, reading a book, or settling in for a peaceful night's sleep, this soft microfiber quilt provides continuous comfort across all seasons.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize your quilt with a custom name or text input to create a truly unique bedding piece or a thoughtful gift.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Stunning Wildlife Theme:</strong> Features a beautifully detailed realistic illustration of a wolf head framed by a dreamcatcher with feathers and beads.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Material:</strong> Crafted from a soft, comfy, and breathable polyester and cotton blend that keeps you cool in summer and warm in winter.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Perfect for indoor bedding, lounging on the couch, or outdoor activities such as camping and family picnics.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Conveniently machine washable in cold water; dries quickly and fluffs up beautifully after air drying.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes &amp; Options:</strong> Choose from various sizes including Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), and King (102\"x91\") with optional matching pillowcases (20''x30'').</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Cotton, Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester, Cotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Indian Wolf</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Western</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Native American style art</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Native</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
